# Tab bar (regression guard)

- **`app/(tabs)/_layout.tsx`:** Use **`#006A60`** for `tabBarActiveTintColor` (not default purple). Use **`@expo/vector-icons` `MaterialCommunityIcons`** for tab icons—not emoji `Text` placeholders.
- **Safe area:** Wrap the app root in **`SafeAreaProvider`** (`app/_layout.tsx`) and drive tab bar **`paddingBottom` / `height`** with **`useSafeAreaInsets()`** so the bar clears the home indicator on iOS.
- **Order:** Home → Activities → Education → Reminders → **More** (`profile/index`).

When merging branches, if this file conflicts, preserve these behaviors rather than reverting to Expo defaults.
